	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でんせつの　こおりポケモン
そのなは　キュレム！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-11T07:35:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:38:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>伝説の　氷ポケモン
その名は　キュレム！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-11T07:35:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:41:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝12、GRIDZ＝15に移動して
・ギザウインで
・でキュレムにカメラを寄せる（要調整）
・続けてpoke10_02_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:29:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:38:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:46:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ソウリュウに　うちこまれた
こおりの　ミサイルは▼
キュレムの　ちからと
プラズマだんの　かがくりょくで▽
つくりだした　もの　なのだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:19:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:38:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ソウリュウに　撃ちこまれた
氷の　ミサイルは▼
キュレムの　能力と
プラズマ団の　科学力で▽
造りだした　もの　なのだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:19:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:41:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・続けてsage7_02_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:02:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:38:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:46:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さて……▼
おまえは　プラズマだんに　とって
ふあんようそ　になりかねない▽
ここで　はいじょ　するのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:19:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T12:32:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さて……▼
おまえは　プラズマ団に　とって
不安要素に　なりかねない▽
ここで　排除するのだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T08:19:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T12:33:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・メッセージ表示後、ヴィオとプラズマ団移動
・続けて
　ライバル登場
　msg_d27r0501_swrival_02_06表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-11T07:07:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
