	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヴィオ『ふむう
いがいに　かしこい　トレーナーだ▼
それほど　ふんべつが　あるのに
なぜ　ワタシたちの　アジトに▽
のりこむ　きけんを　おかすのだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T09:41:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヴィオ『ふむう
存外　さとい　トレーナーだ▼
それほど　分別が　あるのに
なぜ　ワタシたちの　アジトに▽
乗りこむ　危険を　冒すのだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T09:41:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:26:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
